@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@productId = 1

### Create product (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Notebook","price":50000}
> {% client.global.set("productId", response.body.id); %}

### List products (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products

### Read product (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}

### Update product (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Updated Notebook","price":75000}

### Invalid product: price must be positive (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Invalid","price":0}

### Delete product (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}

### Read deleted product (not found response is determined by current exception handling)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
